{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Castle of Blackwater</strong> is a fast-paced<strong>\u00a0</strong>social deduction game with a magical twist. Up to 10 strangers are trapped in a castle filled with danger, deception, and dark forces. Will you fight to survive and escape, or will you betray and eliminate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Faction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Protectors\u00a0</strong>\u2013<strong>\u00a0</strong>Complete tasks, form alliances, and expose the Satanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satanic\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Sabotage, eliminate, and manipulate your way to victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotten\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Play both sides and stir up chaos like a true wildcard</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice &amp; Text Chat</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Scream, scheme,\u00a0or whisper sweet lies into your friends\u2019 ears.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/proxychat-steam.gif?t=1744725841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 Unique Characters &amp; Abilities \u2013</strong> Silence players mid-discussion, transform into a werewolf, or literally read minds to uncover bloody secrets.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/abilitiies-steam.gif?t=1744725841\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ Mini-Games &amp; Tasks</strong> \u2013 Slice veggies like a ninja, chop down a tree like a lumberjack, or light candles like a medieval DJ in a musical memory game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/tasks-steam.gif?t=1744725841\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>200+ Customisation Items </strong>- Equip awesome weapons, flashy shields, and fun emotes. Teabag enemies, dance with a skeleton, or go out in style with custom eliminations!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/cosmetic-steam.gif?t=1744725841\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death is not the end! </strong>\u2013 As a ghost, collect souls to buy power-ups for your team. Influence the game from beyond the grave!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/dpe-steam.gif?t=1744725841\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the <strong>ever-lasting battle </strong>between good and evil, <strong>only one side will survive</strong> to claim the Castle\u2019s victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When lives are at stake and the truth has no meaning, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who will you trust? </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Community.png?t=1744725841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many members are joining our Discord to  keep up to date with  development. We're a small but active team, so if you have any suggestions or questions, we would love to talk to you on <strong>Discord.</strong> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Discord_banner_.png?t=1744725841\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2265920?t=1744725841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744725841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/084c583adf843a5a87bfa0